#: ../../source/contents/installation/index.rst:2
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装指南"

#: ../../source/contents/installation/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"ResourcePackServer can run in two modes: as a **standalone HTTP server** or "
"as an **MCDReforged plugin**."
msgstr "ResourcePackServer 可以以两种模式运行：**独立 HTTP 服务器** 或 **MCDReforged 插件**。"

#: ../../source/contents/installation/index.rst:6
msgid "You only need to choose **one** mode that fits your setup."
msgstr "你只需要选择一种适合你环境的模式。"

#: ../../source/contents/installation/index.rst:11
msgid "Standalone Mode (pip install)"
msgstr "独立模式（pip 安装）"

#: ../../source/contents/installation/index.rst:13
msgid "Install from source or PyPI (future):"
msgstr "从源码或 PyPI 安装（未来支持）："

#: ../../source/contents/installation/index.rst:19
msgid "Or install with uv:"
msgstr "或使用 uv 安装："

#: ../../source/contents/installation/index.rst:25
msgid "Then run:"
msgstr "然后运行："

#: ../../source/contents/installation/index.rst:31
msgid "See :doc:`/contents/usage/index` for more CLI options."
msgstr "更多 CLI 参数请参见 :doc:`/contents/usage/index`。"

#: ../../source/contents/installation/index.rst:36
msgid "MCDReforged Plugin Mode"
msgstr "MCDReforged 插件模式"

#: ../../source/contents/installation/index.rst:38
msgid "Install the plugin via MCDR command:"
msgstr "通过 MCDR 命令安装插件："

#: ../../source/contents/installation/index.rst:44
msgid ""
"Alternatively, download the ``.mcdr`` package from `GitHub Releases <https:/"
"/github.com/Mooling0602/ResourcePackServer/releases>`__ and place it into th"
"e ``plugins/`` directory."
msgstr ""
"或者从 `GitHub Releases <https://github.com/Mooling0602/ResourcePackServer/rele"
"ases>`__ 下载 ``.mcdr`` 包，放入 ``plugins/`` 目录。"

#: ../../source/contents/installation/index.rst:48
msgid "The plugin will auto-load. Use ``!!rps status`` to verify."
msgstr "插件将自动加载。使用 ``!!rps status`` 验证。"

#: ../../source/contents/installation/index.rst:51
msgid "Dependencies"
msgstr "依赖"

#: ../../source/contents/installation/index.rst:53
msgid "This plugin depends on:"
msgstr "此插件依赖："

#: ../../source/contents/installation/index.rst:55
msgid "`MCDReforged <https://github.com/MCDReforged/MCDReforged>`__ >= 2.0.0"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/contents/installation/index.rst:57
msgid "No other external dependencies are required (stdlib-only HTTP server)."
msgstr "不需要其他外部依赖（仅使用标准库 HTTP 服务器）。"

#: ../../source/contents/installation/index.rst:61
msgid ""
"Make sure MCDReforged is installed and configured first. Visit the `MCDR doc"
"s <https://docs.mcdreforged.com>`__ for guidance."
msgstr "请确保已安装并配置了 MCDReforged。请查阅 `MCDR 文档 <https://docs.mcdreforged.com>`__ 获取指导。"
